jobs.description:
Together with your colleagues, you ensure that goods are processed efficiently and accurately throughout the warehouse. You contribute to a safe and organised working environment while helping maintain a smooth flow of products.

• Loading and unloading trucks;
• Sorting goods and shipments;
• Picking orders;
• Packing and preparing orders for shipment;
• Processing incoming and outgoing goods;
• Checking products for quality and quantity;
• Maintaining a safe, clean and organised workplace;
• Supporting the efficient handling of daily logistics operations.

Functie-eisen:
This position is suitable for someone who enjoys physical work and feels comfortable in a warehouse environment. You work carefully, take responsibility for the quality of your work and are willing to work different shifts.

For this position:

• You have MBO-level working and thinking ability through education or experience;
• Experience in logistics is an advantage;
• You are physically fit and willing to perform manual tasks;
• You work accurately and pay attention to quality;
• You are flexible and willing to work in a 4-shift system;
• You have a good command of either Dutch or English;
• You preferably live within 25 kilometres of the work location and have your own transportation.

Truck driver C - Amsterdam 
Date: Aug 25, 2026 
Location: Amsterdam, NL, 1046 BZ 
Company: sligrofoodgroup 
Amsterdam | fixed routes | €3,520 + bonuses 
Are you looking for a truck driver's job where you work during the day, visit unique locations, and earn a good salary? 
Here's what you'll get 
✅ Gross monthly salary up to €3,520 (scale D6), excluding bonuses; 
✅ Overtime and weekend bonuses up to 150% in accordance with the collective labor agreement; 
✅ Workdays between 5:00 a.m. and 4:00 p.m .;; 
✅ Fixed routes in Amsterdam and the surrounding area; 
✅ Driving new electric delivery trucks ; 
✅ Full reimbursement for Code 95 and driver card ; 
✅ 24 vacation days + 3.5 ATV days; 
✅€1,000 in online credit per year for good performance. 
What will you be doing? 
You'll start your day around 5:00 a.m. with a cup of coffee and then head out on your regular route. You'll deliver orders to hospitality customers and other business clients in Amsterdam and the surrounding area. Together with your colleagues, you'll ensure accurate deliveries and bring returns back to the distribution center. Your workday will be over by around 2:00-4:00 p.m. 
You are 
✅ A holder of a Class C driver's license, a valid Code 95, and a driver's card; 
✅ Residing in Amsterdam (area) and possession of own transport is mandatory; 
✅ Customer-friendly and presentable; 
✅ Physically fit and enjoy being active; 
✅ Fluent in Dutch and/or English; 
✅ Experience as a distribution driver is a plus. 
